# Ready-made API requests. Open in VS Code (extension "REST Client") or a
# JetBrains IDE and click "Send Request" above each block.
# The login response is stored, so later requests reuse its token automatically.
# Switch @base to the server address after deployment (Phase 7).

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health (no token needed)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Register alice
POST {{base}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{"login": "alice", "password": "Correct-Horse-42!", "repeat_password": "Correct-Horse-42!"}

### Register bob (to invite later)
POST {{base}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{"login": "bob", "password": "Battery-Staple-7#", "repeat_password": "Battery-Staple-7#"}

### Log in as alice
# @name alice
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login": "alice", "password": "Correct-Horse-42!"}

### Log in as bob
# @name bob
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login": "bob", "password": "Battery-Staple-7#"}

### alice creates a project (she becomes the owner)
# @name project
POST {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Apollo", "description": "Moon landing"}

### alice lists her projects (with documents and her role)
GET {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### Project details
GET {{base}}/project/{{project.response.body.id}}/info
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### bob cannot see it yet -> 404
GET {{base}}/project/{{project.response.body.id}}/info
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.access_token}}

### alice invites bob -> 201, bob is now a participant
POST {{base}}/project/{{project.response.body.id}}/invite?user=bob
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### bob updates the details (participants may modify) -> 200
PUT {{base}}/project/{{project.response.body.id}}/info
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Apollo 11", "description": "First crewed Moon landing"}

### bob tries to delete -> 403 (participants cannot delete)
DELETE {{base}}/project/{{project.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.access_token}}

### alice deletes the project -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/project/{{project.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### No token -> 401
GET {{base}}/projects
